  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115988",
      "title": "The Starting Project & The Need For A Centralized Service",
      "lectureOrder": 176,
      "videoOrder": 168,
      "sourceHash": "a792917cbfe4f270cc821cd6aa4d7388c2f84c496e02bd4d3bd16dd7fd3b8a37",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.8,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So let's start with services.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "What was the idea behind services again?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 11.97,
          "en": "Well, the idea is that services are these things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.97,
          "end": 16.32,
          "en": "these classes that in the end can be used to share logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.32,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "and data across the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "So across multiple Components, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "And to do that, you build those centralized services,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "which can then be injected into multiple Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 33.51,
          "en": "but also into Directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.51,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "or other services so that these Components, Directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 43.07,
          "en": "and services can use the shared logic and or data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "That's the idea behind services,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 50.88,
          "en": "and to practice the usage of services",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.88,
          "end": 53.94,
          "en": "I prepared a brand new starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "which you find attached as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "and where as always, you should run NPM install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 61.623,
          "en": "to install all dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 68.21000000000001,
          "en": "And thereafter, NPM start to start that development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 68.49,
          "end": 69.66,
          "en": "And once you did that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.66,
          "end": 73.35,
          "en": "you should see this application here on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 73.35,
          "end": 76.56,
          "en": "if you visit local host 4,200.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "Though it's worth noting that at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "this application does really work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "We can theoretically add some tasks here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 86.58,
          "en": "but at the moment they don't show up here in that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "And changing that filter also doesn't do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 93.81,
          "en": "but that's exactly what we'll use a service for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.81,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "because in this starting application I provided to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 100.86,
          "en": "we have multiple task related Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.86,
          "end": 102.96000000000001,
          "en": "that are working together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.96000000000001,
          "end": 106.05,
          "en": "We have the new task component, which renders the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.05,
          "end": 108.27000000000001,
          "en": "and collects the user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.27000000000001,
          "end": 111.45,
          "en": "And then we have the tasks list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.45,
          "end": 115.74000000000001,
          "en": "which has the task item component as a nested component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.74000000000001,
          "end": 120.54,
          "en": "which in the end is responsible for outputting the tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.54,
          "end": 123.693,
          "en": "And it's also responsible for managing that filter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 127.38,
          "en": "And therefore, since we essentially have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.38,
          "end": 129.63,
          "en": "that tasks list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.63,
          "end": 133.92,
          "en": "and that new task component that need to work together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.92,
          "end": 137.19,
          "en": "to manage these tasks, it makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 141.18,
          "en": "to use such a service for managing the tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.18,
          "end": 144.93,
          "en": "This also has the advantage that if we add more Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 149.19,
          "en": "to this application that needs to work with these tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.19,
          "end": 152.37,
          "en": "these new Components can also use the service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.37,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "So managing that tasks data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.95,
          "end": 159.03,
          "en": "and potentially also logic in a centralized place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.03,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "can make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.28,
          "end": 164.94,
          "en": "And therefore, here I'll add a new tasks service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.94,
          "end": 167.28,
          "en": "that allows me to manage these tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.28,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "So manage a list of tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "and that will then provide these tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.11,
          "en": "to the tasks list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.11,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "And we'll build this in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 181.11,
          "en": "Of course, if you feel like it, definitely try building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.11,
          "end": 182.61,
          "en": "that service on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.61,
          "end": 185.97,
          "en": "and maybe also try injecting it into the Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.97,
          "end": 188.25,
          "en": "that need it and use it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.25,
          "end": 191.64,
          "en": "But of course, it's also fine if we simply build it together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.64,
          "end": 192.993,
          "en": "over the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
